**Concentrate total: 6000 µL.** Add ethanol 96% q.s. to **30.00 mL** only after the pre-mix record has been reviewed.

Nominal active total under the stated approximation: **797500 ppm**. Nominal carried DPG: **202500 ppm**. They sum to 1,000,000 ppm in the supplied-stock concentrate. The DPG contribution is deliberate stock carrier, not a perfume note and not DEP.

## Optimization claim boundary

The pre-mix optimization is complete when the current-stock contract, arithmetic, parent-dose guard, composite-natural OAV screen, temporal screen, and architecture checks have been rerun and recorded below. This can reject internally inconsistent candidates before mixing. It cannot prove that V3 smells good or that every person's nose will read Sambac; those remain physical sensory questions after the computational pass. No pleasantness model, OAV value, or gate score is allowed to negate the user's actual observation that V2's benzyl-acetate direction failed.

